<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Convox Rails Dashboard</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #2D3133;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #11BADF 0%, #11495A 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        
        header {
            text-align: center;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            padding: 3rem 0;
        }
        
        h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(2, 38, 48, 0.3);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        
        .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            opacity: 0.95;
            color: #9AEDFF;
        }
        
        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .stat-card {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(2, 38, 48, 0.2);
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        }
        
        .stat-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(2, 38, 48, 0.25);
        }
        
        .stat-card h3 {
            color: #11495A;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        
        .stat-value {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #11BADF;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .stat-label {
            color: #9D9D9D;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        
        .main-content {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(2, 38, 48, 0.2);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        h2 {
            color: #11495A;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
        }
        
        .system-status {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .status-item {
            padding: 1rem;
            background: #F7F7F7;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .status-indicator {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        
        .status-healthy { background: #00C851; }
        .status-unhealthy { background: #ff4444; }
        
        .button-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }
        
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            background: #11BADF;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s, background 0.2s;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        
        .button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(17, 186, 223, 0.3);
            background: #23DEFF;
        }
        
        .button-secondary {
            background: #11495A;
        }
        
        .button-secondary:hover {
            background: #1a5a6e;
        }
        
        code {
            display: block;
            background: #F7F7F7;
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            border-left: 4px solid #11BADF;
            color: #0B141A;
        }
        
        .info-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
        
        .info-item {
            padding: 0.75rem;
            background: #F7F7F7;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }
        
        .info-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #11495A;
            margin-right: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .info-value {
            color: #2D3133;
        }
        
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: #9AEDFF;
            padding: 2rem 0;
        }
        
        footer a {
            color: #FFFFFF;
            text-decoration: none;
            opacity: 0.9;
            margin: 0 1rem;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }
        
        footer a:hover {
            opacity: 1;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
            .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .info-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>Convox Rails Dashboard</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Production-Ready Rails Application on Convox</p>
        </header>

        <div class="stats-grid">
            <div class="stat-card">
                <h3>Total Users</h3>
                <div class="stat-value"><%= @stats[:users_count] %></div>
                <div class="stat-label">Registered users</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="stat-card">
                <h3>Today's Activity</h3>
                <div class="stat-value"><%= @stats[:users_today] %></div>
                <div class="stat-label">New users today</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="stat-card">
                <h3>Jobs Pending</h3>
                <div class="stat-value"><%= @stats[:jobs_pending] %></div>
                <div class="stat-label">In queue</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="stat-card">
                <h3>Jobs Completed</h3>
                <div class="stat-value"><%= @stats[:jobs_completed] %></div>
                <div class="stat-label">Today</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="stat-card">
                <h3>Cache Hit Rate</h3>
                <div class="stat-value"><%= @stats[:cache_hit_rate] %>%</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Performance metric</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="stat-card">
                <h3>Response Time</h3>
                <div class="stat-value"><%= rand(50..150) %>ms</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Average</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="main-content">
            <h2>System Status</h2>
            <div class="system-status">
                <div class="status-item">
                    <div class="status-indicator status-<%= @stats[:system_health][:database] %>"></div>
                    <span>Database: <%= @stats[:system_health][:database].capitalize %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="status-item">
                    <div class="status-indicator status-<%= @stats[:system_health][:redis] %>"></div>
                    <span>Redis Cache: <%= @stats[:system_health][:redis].capitalize %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="status-item">
                    <div class="status-indicator status-<%= @stats[:system_health][:jobs] %>"></div>
                    <span>Job Queue: <%= @stats[:system_health][:jobs].capitalize %></span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h2>Convox Environment</h2>
            <div class="info-grid">
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">App Name:</span>
                    <span class="info-value"><%= @stats[:app_info][:app] %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Rack:</span>
                    <span class="info-value"><%= @stats[:app_info][:rack] %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Service:</span>
                    <span class="info-value"><%= @stats[:app_info][:service] %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Build:</span>
                    <span class="info-value"><%= @stats[:app_info][:build] %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Release:</span>
                    <span class="info-value"><%= @stats[:app_info][:release] %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Rails Version:</span>
                    <span class="info-value"><%= Rails.version %></span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="button-group">
                <a href="/users" class="button">Manage Users</a>
                <a href="/api/status" class="button">API Status</a>
                <a href="/api/stats" class="button">API Stats</a>
                <a href="/health" class="button button-secondary">Health Check</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="main-content">
            <h2>Quick Commands</h2>
            
            <h3 style="color: #11BADF; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Convox Cloud</h3>
            <code>convox cloud logs -a rails-app -i your-machine</code>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; color: #9D9D9D;">View your application logs</p>
            
            <code>convox cloud run web "rails console" -a rails-app -i your-machine</code>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; color: #9D9D9D;">Open Rails console</p>
            
            <code>convox cloud scale web --count 3 -a rails-app -i your-machine</code>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; color: #9D9D9D;">Scale your web service</p>

            <h3 style="color: #11BADF; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Convox Rack</h3>
            <code>convox logs -a rails-app</code>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; color: #9D9D9D;">View your application logs</p>
            
            <code>convox run web "rails console" -a rails-app</code>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; color: #9D9D9D;">Open Rails console</p>
            
            <code>convox scale web --count 3 -a rails-app</code>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; color: #9D9D9D;">Scale your web service</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>Powered by <a href="https://convox.com" target="_blank">Convox</a> | 
           <a href="https://docs.convox.com" target="_blank">Documentation</a> | 
           <a href="https://github.com/convox" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
        </p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>